{"s": {"beats": [], "code": "doc11 = thing(\"document\", x=-3.2, h=3.0, color=\"blue\")\nenter(doc11, \"pop\", dur=0.7)\nwhen(\"custom maps\")\ngear11 = thing(\"gear\", x=0.4, h=2.6, color=\"teal\")\nenter(gear11, \"grow\", dur=0.6)\nwhen(\"hundreds of server admins\")\nclone(doc11, n=5)\nflow(doc11, gear11, item=\"coin\", n=8)\n", "duration": 14.2, "narration": "As GTA 6 rolls out its online multiplayer ecosystem, server owners will pay designers for custom maps, clothing packs, and in-game scripts. One digital file built once can be sold to hundreds of server admins over and over.", "objects": [{"id": "n0", "obj": "document"}, {"id": "n1", "obj": "gear"}, {"id": "n2", "obj": "coin"}], "theme": "visual", "words": [["As", 0.0], ["GTA", 0.3], ["6", 0.68], ["rolls", 1.1], ["out", 1.36], ["its", 1.62], ["online", 1.8], ["multiplayer", 2.14], ["ecosystem,", 2.58], ["server", 3.78], ["owners", 3.94], ["will", 4.28], ["pay", 4.54], ["designers", 4.7], ["for", 5.12], ["custom", 5.38], ["maps,", 5.68], ["clothing", 6.42], ["packs,", 6.64], ["and", 7.36], ["in-game", 7.46], ["scripts.", 7.84], ["One", 8.88], ["digital", 9.06], ["file", 9.36], ["built", 9.78], ["once", 10.02], ["can", 10.3], ["be", 10.56], ["sold", 10.68], ["to", 10.86], ["hundreds", 11.06], ["of", 11.3], ["server", 11.56], ["admins", 11.86], ["over", 12.32], ["and", 12.6], ["over.", 12.78]]}, "script": 1, "v": false}